<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Deadlock Battle</font>

43
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Dad!</font>

44
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good!</font>

45
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no, Gamatatsu!
Let's get out of here!</font>

46
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Why, why?</font>

47
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter, just hurry up!</font>

48
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Manda and Orochimaru,
Katsuyu and Tsunade...</font>

49
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all bring back memories...</font>

50
00:02:30,210 --> 00:02:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we have a reunion
or something, Jiraiya?</font>

51
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! I summon you after a long absence</font>

52
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you make these boring jokes.</font>

53
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time to conclude this long,
fateful confrontation has come.</font>

54
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm bringing Orochimaru down,
here and now!</font>

55
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Orochimaru...</font>

56
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd you have to summon me
to a place like this?!</font>

57
00:03:04,990 --> 00:03:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... I'm going to eat you up!</font>

58
00:03:07,450 --> 00:03:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that, Manda-sama...</font>

59
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will be duly rewarded.</font>

60
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:14,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who said I'm talking to you?!</font>

61
00:03:14,790 --> 00:03:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so flippant, brat!</font>

62
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Orochimaru...</font>

63
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I expect you to prepare
a sacrificial offering of 100 people later.</font>

64
00:03:32,730 --> 00:03:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though Orochimaru-sama is
Manda's master,</font>

65
00:03:34,270 --> 00:03:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if Manda learns that Orochimaru-sama
can't use Jutsu,</font>

66
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Manda will no doubt
double-cross him.</font>

67
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite the fact that he had
no other choice, in his condition,</font>

68
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was too risky for Orochimaru-sama
to summon Manda.</font>

69
00:03:46,950 --> 00:03:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Katsuyu... take that kid to Shizune!</font>

70
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am.</font>

71
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I can fight, too!</font>

72
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune-sama, please take care of this child.</font>

73
00:04:13,730 --> 00:04:14,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

74
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, the battle is going to get
quite vicious from now.</font>

75
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please go far away with my clone
and conceal yourself...</font>

76
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:28,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what Tsunade-sama wants.</font>

77
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

78
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

79
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll hang you out until you're dry!</font>

80
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been wanting a snakeskin wallet...</font>

81
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru,
you've sunk too deeply into vice!</font>

82
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are no longer comrades.</font>

83
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Comrades?</font>

84
00:05:12,290 --> 00:05:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That word makes me shiver.</font>

85
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:16,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today is the last day that
we are called Sannin!</font>

86
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Acid Slime!</font>

87
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll start with this one!</font>

88
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Katsuyu!</font>

89
00:06:07,930 --> 00:06:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

90
00:06:28,150 --> 00:06:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

91
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

92
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade! Stay away!</font>

93
00:06:43,790 --> 00:06:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bunta! Give me some oil!</font>

94
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

95
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style!</font>

96
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Toad Oil Flamethrower!</font>

97
00:07:13,990 --> 00:07:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... How's that?</font>

98
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did it work?</font>

99
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's...</font>

100
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:32,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Molten skin! He shed his skin!</font>

101
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bunta! Under the earth!</font>

102
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

103
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the tail?!</font>

104
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep it shut!</font>

105
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're Sannin, all right.</font>

106
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:01,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dealing with two of them is rough.</font>

107
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade!</font>

108
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:11,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well now, I can kill you
by wringing your neck.</font>

109
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:14,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Chakra...</font>

110
00:08:15,550 --> 00:08:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

111
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you say
you won't die in battle,</font>

112
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't have a choice if
I rip your neck off...</font>

113
00:08:23,850 --> 00:08:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Tsunade?</font>

114
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many minutes...</font>

115
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many seconds can I hold on...?</font>

116
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to put it on the line!</font>

117
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine!</font>

118
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:43,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time we put an end to this!</font>

119
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Ridiculous!</font>

120
00:09:05,690 --> 00:09:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not done yet!</font>

121
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

122
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

123
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama... Not that...!</font>

124
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's reached her limit...</font>

125
00:09:43,890 --> 00:09:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

126
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

127
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've hurled him around that much,
yet he's still...</font>

128
00:10:05,410 --> 00:10:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is as far as you can go.</font>

129
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

130
00:10:16,470 --> 00:10:17,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't rest!</font>

131
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep beating him.</font>

132
00:10:26,930 --> 00:10:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the battle...</font>

133
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where I put my life on the line!</font>

134
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama!</font>

135
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you go!</font>

136
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will stay with me until the end!</font>

137
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

138
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hit him and hit him.
Something's different...</font>

139
00:11:10,270 --> 00:11:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?
This... strange sense of discomfort?</font>

140
00:11:43,890 --> 00:11:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, with this...!</font>

141
00:11:49,850 --> 00:11:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over!</font>

142
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He took a direct hit!</font>

143
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was it.</font>

144
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

145
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:15,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...</font>

146
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Putting me in this position!</font>

147
00:12:29,850 --> 00:12:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to eat you and kill you,</font>

148
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I can't even chew you up
with this hole in my mouth...</font>

149
00:12:37,270 --> 00:12:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time, if we meet again,
be prepared!</font>

150
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade...</font>

151
00:13:13,730 --> 00:13:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you won't heal me,
I still have one way.</font>

152
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A way to resurrect these arms.</font>

153
00:13:38,290 --> 00:13:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village...
I'll destroy it... without fail.</font>

154
00:13:45,170 --> 00:13:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, it would be nice
if we could meet again...</font>

155
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My comrades...
Tsunade and Jiraiya.</font>

156
00:13:57,310 --> 00:13:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That face...?!</font>

157
00:14:00,610 --> 00:14:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In some way or another,
he took someone else's body...?!</font>

158
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder,
when we went at it a while ago,</font>

159
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't get the same feeling
from him that I did in the past...</font>

160
00:14:14,830 --> 00:14:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true elixir of life.</font>

161
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:18,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my...</font>

162
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my immortality!</font>

163
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some day, in the future...</font>

164
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

165
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bones in my ribs and feet
are broken...</font>

166
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The side effects of the Jutsu
are starting...</font>

167
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body is... already...</font>

168
00:15:18,230 --> 00:15:22,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade, you haven't changed.
You're no good at wagers.</font>

169
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage is my dream!</font>

170
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you one week.</font>

171
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can master that Jutsu,</font>

172
00:15:33,530 --> 00:15:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge that you have
what it takes to become the Hokage...</font>

173
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and give you this necklace.</font>

174
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no joke!</font>

175
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:43,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I have three days,
I'll master this Jutsu!</font>

176
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Men don't go back on their word!</font>

177
00:15:50,590 --> 00:15:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the grandson of the Hokage who
built the Village Hidden in Leaves, so...!</font>

178
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it.
Men don't go back on their word!</font>

179
00:15:58,970 --> 00:16:04,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! I'll become just like Grandfather.
And the Hokage name will be mine!</font>

180
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming Hokage is my dream!</font>

181
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love this village and my comrades.</font>

182
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I want to protect them.</font>

183
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An existence that protects everyone.</font>

184
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming Hokage is my dream...</font>

185
00:16:33,300 --> 00:16:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like you... to take this.</font>

186
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any time now, the side effects...</font>

187
00:16:46,310 --> 00:16:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

188
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

189
00:16:55,660 --> 00:17:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing... If I rest a bit, I'll return
to my young form.</font>

190
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:03,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll rest in town.</font>

191
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when Naruto wakes up,
We'll return to Leaf Village.</font>

192
00:17:07,130 --> 00:17:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade...</font>

193
00:17:09,630 --> 00:17:12,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting now, don't call me Tsunade.
Call me...</font>

194
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage?!</font>

195
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:23,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Granny Tsunade is
the Fifth Hokage starting today...</font>

196
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, you look disgruntled, Naruto.</font>

197
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, compared to the old man,
the Third Hokage,</font>

198
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's something...</font>

199
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">rough-natured and kind of selfish...</font>

200
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">loose with money, catty and stupid...</font>

201
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somehow, I'm going to worry
if she can do it properly.</font>

202
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, would you like
to order something...</font>

203
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, a 50-year-old lady
transforming into a young lady...</font>

204
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it okay for the person who
will become Hokage</font>

205
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to lie to everyone, I wonder...?</font>

206
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go outside, brat!</font>

207
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like before...</font>

208
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite how I look,
I'm going to be the Fifth Hokage.</font>

209
00:18:33,130 --> 00:18:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shouldn't take
this short brat of a foe seriously...</font>

210
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one is enough...</font>

211
00:18:40,930 --> 00:18:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't call me brat!</font>

212
00:18:44,010 --> 00:18:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may be like this now,
but I'll be Hokage some day!</font>

213
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

214
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another brow flick?!</font>

215
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Become a fine man...</font>

216
00:19:49,450 --> 00:19:52,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and, a fine Hokage.</font>

217
00:19:57,670 --> 00:19:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

218
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Shall we go home?</font>

219
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To our hometown the Leaf Village!</font>

220
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I haven't eaten yet...!</font>

221
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't try to distract me by laughing!</font>

222
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nawaki... Dan...</font>

223
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the boy who will inherit your dreams,
my beloved ones,</font>

224
00:20:57,310 --> 00:20:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is right here!</font>

225
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

226
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

227
00:21:10,750 --> 00:21:15,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

228
00:21:10,750 --> 00:21:15,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

229
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

230
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

231
00:21:20,530 --> 00:21:25,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

232
00:21:20,530 --> 00:21:25,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

233
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

234
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

235
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:35,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

236
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:35,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

237
00:21:35,770 --> 00:21:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

238
00:21:35,770 --> 00:21:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

239
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

240
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

241
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

242
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

243
00:21:54,230 --> 00:21:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

244
00:21:54,230 --> 00:21:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

245
00:21:58,660 --> 00:22:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

246
00:21:58,660 --> 00:22:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

247
00:22:04,810 --> 00:22:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

248
00:22:04,810 --> 00:22:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

249
00:22:13,010 --> 00:22:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

250
00:22:13,010 --> 00:22:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

251
00:22:23,690 --> 00:22:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

252
00:22:23,690 --> 00:22:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

253
00:22:31,130 --> 00:22:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

254
00:22:31,130 --> 00:22:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

255
00:22:37,580 --> 00:22:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yahoo! Here we are
at a hot spring spot!</font>

256
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:45,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">While Pervy Sage is gawking at women,
and Granny Tsunade is out somewhere,</font>

257
00:22:46,050 --> 00:22:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm gonna relax and enjoy myself!</font>

258
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What?! Who worked over my room?!</font>

259
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't know who they are,</font>

260
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">but I'm gonna find them
and kick their butts!</font>

261
00:23:00,190 --> 00:23:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Naruto's Strange Hot Springs Side Trip."</font>

